   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Present tense verbs",
     "texto": [
      "For **διαβάζω**, the «he/she» form is **διαβάζει**; for **γράφω**, it is **γράφει**. The ending helps you know who is doing the action, even if you don't say **εγώ** («I») or **αυτός** («he»).",
      "**Και** means «and» or «also», depending on the context. **Δεν** goes before the verb to form a negative: **Δεν δουλεύω** (I don't work)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
